        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, because of the extensive time required for clinical development and regulatory review of a candidate we may develop, it is possible that, before any of our candidates can be commercialized, any related patent may expire or remain in force for only a short period following commercialization, thereby limiting protection such patent would afford the respective product or products and any competitive advantage such patent may provide.",
